#16701
Giant Remort Quest~
So you want to be a Giant?  What makes you so special?
Giants have to be few and far in between, otherwise there'd
be nothing left to eat in the world.  If you think you have
what it takes to be a giant, prove it by completing these
four tasks.  
To become a giant, find and defeat these four giants in
combat.
1. The stone giant chief in the forgotten forest.
2. The Fire Giant that slams his huge flaming sword into
   the earth again and again in the Silver Dutchess Mines.
3. The forest giant in the Tombs of Tarin.
4. The cloud giant that wears the plate of the clouds in
   in The Steading.
~
To become a giant, find and defeat these four giants in
combat.
1. The stone giant chief in the forgotten forest.
2. The Fire Giant that slams his huge flaming sword into
   the earth again and again in the Silver Dutchess Mines.
3. The forest giant in the Tombs of Tarin.
4. The cloud giant that wears the plate of the clouds in
   in The Steading.
~
