#16702
Werewolf Remort Quest~
Werewolves are strange and ancient beasts.  If you wish 
to become one, you must follow this path.  Find the flower 
in LupusVille, slay the master werewolf in that resides in 
Lord Vrolok's Estate, conquer the shewolf in the Isles of 
Myst and best Fernir in Asgard.
~
