#16704
Demon Remort Quest~
The most grotesque evils to ever exist have all
been demons.  These unnatural abominations of life 
are beyond nature.  Often in positions of power, 
these creatures fear nothing, and for a good reason.  
Few mortals are insane enough to wish for the life 
of a demon, but there are those that are that hungry 
for power.  Are you?

If so, do the following and your wish will be granted:
Start by taking the Trial of the Initiate and routing 
the shadow demon that is there.  Then goto the Fields 
of Chaos and slay the proper glowing powerful red 
demon.  Somewhere within the Under Dark a bodak has 
built a mansion.  Thrash this demon and bring me his 
black wand inlaid with gold symbols.  Leave this realm 
and enter the Astrial Extensions to confront a Marilith 
demon.  When you are done return to me.
~
Do the following and your wish will be granted:
Start by taking the Trial of the Initiate and routing 
the shadow demon that is there.  Then goto the Fields 
of Chaos and slay the proper glowing powerful red 
demon.  Somewhere within the Under Dark a bodak has 
built a mansion.  Thrash this demon and bring me his 
black wand inlaid with gold symbols.  Leave this realm 
and enter the Astrial Extensions to confront a Marilith 
demon.  When you are done return to me.
~
