#16705
Fire Elemental Remort Quest~
To master the world one must master the elements, for they
are the foundation of the world.  There is nothing more
fundamental or important to the existance of the world than
the elements.  If one totally commits themself and succumbs
to the eternal forces, one can become one with the elements
and become part of the elements.  Want alone is not enough
to be granted this.  One must complete several tasks as well.
The tasks that will make thee an elemental are as follows...
Bring an elemental amulet from the elemental canyon.
Extinguish the Fire Elemental in Dragonor Keep.
Plow the earth elemental of the Under Dark Extensions under.
Best the Sea-Dragon in the Oceans of the pirate isles.
Goto the Hightower and prove that you are the better of
the Grandmaster of the Conclave.
~
The tasks that will make thee an elemental are as follows...
Bring an elemental amulet from the elemental canyon.
Extinguish the Fire Elemental in Dragonor Keep.
Plow the earth elemental of the Under Dark Extensions under.
Best the Sea-Dragon in the Oceans of the pirate isles.
Goto the Hightower and prove that you are the better of
the Grandmaster of the Conclave.
~
