#16706
Izarti Remort Quest~
The izarti are a divine and serene pride which embody the 
quintessential agility and wisdom of eons of reflection.
For unnumbered years they have quietly stalked the world, 
seeking wisdom, protecting the just, and quenching evil.  
If you wish to be among their ranks, you must prove
yourself worthy in mind and body.  Those with an evil
heart cannot be izarti.  Those izarti that do sway to evil
suffer for it.  If you have a good heart and can complete
the tasks set before you, then your heart will purr with
joy for the rest of your days.
Travel through the portals of time and put an end to the 
saber toothed tiger.  Lord Skul's magist is creating
abominations.  Stop him before you grant the King of Tarin
eternal peace.  The devil's Huntsman, who serves with
the three witches needs to be stopped, permanently.  Return
here with proof when you have completed these tasks.
~
Travel through the portals of time and put an end to the 
saber toothed tiger.  Lord Skul's magist is creating
abominations.  Stop him before you grant the King of Tarin
eternal peace.  The devil's Huntsman, who serves with
the three witches needs to be stopped, permanently.  Return
here with proof when you have completed these tasks.
~
