#16707
Faerie Remort Quest~
   Faeries are curious little troublemakers.  Sometimes they bring good fortune
to those they visit.  Sometimes they bring resow tears of the past.  Other
times they serve the pious.  But mostly, these fairy tale creatures exist soley
to ammuse children.  If you really wish to become one of these, you must
complete the following tasks, to prove that you are worthy.  In Olympus prove
that you have more good fortune than the goddess of good fortune.  Travel to
Meth-Merutl and put and end to the pain of the Enchantress.  The minion of nool
is doing very unholy things near the temple of Hochenyana.  It must be stopped.
Track down Peter in the duke's castle and put an end to him.  Return here with
proof once you have completed the tasks.    
~
In Olympus prove that you have more good fortune than the goddess of good
fortune.  Travel to Meth-Merutl and put and end to the pain of the Enchantress.
The minion of nool is doing very unholy things near the temple of Hochenyana.
It must be stopped.  Track down Peter in the duke's castle and put an end to
him.  Return here with proof once you have completed the tasks.    
~
