#16708
Amara Remort Quest~
Emerging from their watery realms, the Amara have recently revealed themselves 
to the rest of the civilized world.  Long have the dwelt in the deeps of 
lakes and oceans, unseen by the airbreathers of the world.  Now that they have 
revealed themselves to the rest of the world, they are the target of much 
interest.  These amphibians are not total physical masters of the sea, and there 
are forms in the water that are a bane to the Amara.  If you were to kill off
some of these banes, the amara will welcome you as one of their own in every way.
To become an Amara slay the following, and bring their severed heads to me.  
Travel to Atlantis and slay the Giant Octopus.  Deep in the Pech Community lurks
a cave fisher.  It must be slain!  Grendal in Asgard is a bane to all those 
that pass by.  Put an end to it's wrath.  A great white shark lurks by a lagoon
near the isles of the pirate lords savaging all who come near.  Filet it.
~
To become an Amara slay the following, and bring their severed heads to me.  
Travel to Atlantis and slay the Giant Octopus.  Deep in the Pech Community lurks
a cave fisher.  It must be slain!  Grendal in Asgard is a bane to all those 
that pass by.  Put an end to it's wrath.  A great white shark lurks by a lagoon
near the isles of the pirate lords savaging all who come near.  Filet it.
~
