#16709
Undead Remort Quest~
The great philosophers and mages have long pondered the existence
of life after death. You have the opportunity to pass beyond the veil
of life and become part of the after-life. Beware of what you seek however
for the forces of life and death do battle for the souls of those who cross
over and sometimes the soul is left in limbo between the peace of death and
the redemption of life. In this state you will become un-dead and you will
ever seek the living to devour their lifeforce...for only that way can you
sustain your existence. Want alone is not enough to pass over the veil
to be granted this look at the other side.  One must complete several tasks 
as well.
The tasks that will make thee not dead and not alive are as follows...
Bring the corpse of the young girl from Lupusville(Night).
Defeat the undead King Tarin in his tomb.
Put to rest the spirit of a murdered child at the Windmill.
~
The tasks that will make thee not dead and not alive are as follows...
Bring the corpse of the young girl from Lupusville(Night).
Defeat the undead King Tarin in his tomb.
Put to rest the spirit of a murdered child at the Windmill.
~
