Ascended human quest~
To become a superhuman, you must prove yourself to hold your own within their ranks!
First, take out the grandmaster of the conclave and bring me his ward.
Then journey to Duke Arilan's castle and meet his champion in battle.
Lastly, destroy the human ruler of midgaard.
Return to me once you have completed these tasks and I shall make you a demigod!
~
Take out the grandmaster of the conclave and take his ward, meet Duke Arilan's champion in battle, destroy the human ruler of midgaard.
~
