The man begins slowly, but as he talks, his pace quickens:

 "Look down.  Now back up.  You're in The Temple of the Apprentice.
  Look down.  Now back up.  You're in The Temple of the Apprentice.
  You are now a super-human.  Anything is possible when you're more than human.
  I'm on a horse."

And indeed, everything the man says is true.
You are a Superhuman.
