#16751
ascended halfling quest~
Halflings are a very lithe and lucky bunch. To be the greatest among their ranks, finish the following tasks:
First, bring yourself extra luck with a goodluck charm.  It can be found among those who will fall to their death without it.
Next, bring me the dagger of the thief leader; halflings have long been known for their apt abilities at the art of thievery.
Last, I will need the head of a troll trickster. Since long ago, there has been a struggle between halflings and trolls, and it all started when a halfling didn't become a troll's dinner.
Then, and only then, shall you be as lithe and lucky as the best halflings.
~
Collect a goodluck charm, a dagger of the thief leader, and kill the troll trickster.
~
