#16752
ascended elf quest~
To become within the upper echelons of the elves, you must prove dedication to the race.  Above all else, we loathe our darker cousins, the drow.
Your first task is to kill the great drow warrior in the Under Dark.
Then travel to the city of the drow and take out two of the matron mothers there, and bring me their ring and bracers.
Bring to me the heads and items I require and you shall be a great elf indeed.
~
Kill the great drow warrior in the Under dark, then travel to the city of the drow and take out two of the matron mothers and bring back their ring and bracers.
~
