#16753
ascended drow quest~
How I hate the light elves! They banished us to the bowels of the Earth so long ago...if you exact revenge on them, I shall grant you powers beyond your imaginings.
There is an elven prince held captive in the pirate isles...kill him.
Then journey past the well and take down the elven maiden and bring me her earrings.
Third, enter the valley and kill the elven champion.
These four tasks shall make you a god among drow!
~
Kill the captive elven prince in the pirate isles, kill the elven maiden beyond the well and bring her earrings and destroy the elven champion.
~
