   A pulsing deep purple light twines around your legs, then your body,
arms, and finally, your head.  Hundreds of small spiders follow that light,
crawling over and biting every inch of your body.  You feel them in your
eyes, your ears, and on the inside of your gaping mouth.  The light recedes,
and the spiders with it.
&00
Suddenly you realize how well you can see in the darkness, how well you can
hear the sounds around you, and you feel the blackest of magics pulsing in
the very core of your being.  
&00
You are Dark Drow.
~
#16754
ascended dwarf quest~
Yargh! You want to be more powerful? Drink more mead than you ever thought possible?! I can make it happen! You just have to prove your alleigence to the dwarves!
You will have to kill an example of each of our enemies.  First is the giant Regtorth, over past the thousand mile road.
Second is an orc known as Jarre, who is hiding below the ground.
Last, bring me the head of the king of the trolls, Unger.
~
Kill the giant Regtorth, the orc Jarre, and the king of the trolls, Unger.
~
