#16755
ascended minotaur quest~
Being a minotaur is not as easy as it looks. Horns are an unwieldy weapon and walking on two hooves requires much practice.
However, if you are willing to put in the work, they are a formiddable foe indeed.
To become a truly powerful minotaur, you will need to do three tasks:
First, bring me the hoof of the great bull constellation.
Second, bring me a pair of black minotaur horns.
Last, kill the grand master minotaur to prove you can handle your own around minotaurs.
Finish these and you will become the new grand master minotaur!
~
Collect the hooves of taurus and black horns of a minotaur and take down the minotaur grand master.
~
